---
/**
 * Seamless integrations — Figma section.
 *
 * A thin wrapper: all layout, styling and behaviour live in the shared
 * `_shared/IntegrationTabs.astro` primitive; this file supplies the content.
 * It is the paste unit, because the embed route renders sections with no props
 * — so props have to be applied here, inside a section file, not from the page.
 *
 * To reuse this section on another page, add
 * `src/sections/<page>/Integrations.astro` with the same two lines and a
 * different `groups` array. One implementation, N pages.
 */
